    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578980/extras/2ab648aab1edc8d09f112e991c00e296.poster.avif?t=1751154646\" width=600 height=162 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578980/extras/2ab648aab1edc8d09f112e991c00e296.webm?t=1751154646\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578980/extras/2ab648aab1edc8d09f112e991c00e296.mp4?t=1751154646\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lovecraft Locker 2: Tentacle Breach</strong> is a casual strategy adult game where you take the role of a tentacle entity that can infect lockers and has vengeance on the scientists who captured you. Navigate different areas in the research facility where you're currently contained and defeat different researchers, scientists, and guards along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Will you be able to escape your containment?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578980/extras/8ee7702ff7b47aa96a2e29712d76b0c0.poster.avif?t=1751154646\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578980/extras/8ee7702ff7b47aa96a2e29712d76b0c0.webm?t=1751154646\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578980/extras/8ee7702ff7b47aa96a2e29712d76b0c0.mp4?t=1751154646\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you're a Tentacle Monster, and your goal is to escape and conquer the research facility that captured and currently contains you. However, this research facility is protected by armed guards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can conquer an area in the game by possessing lockers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Press arrow keys or A / D to navigate each locker.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578980/extras/2326ebb2d2b4d8b92ddb945d94432d4e.poster.avif?t=1751154646\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578980/extras/2326ebb2d2b4d8b92ddb945d94432d4e.webm?t=1751154646\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578980/extras/2326ebb2d2b4d8b92ddb945d94432d4e.mp4?t=1751154646\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Press SPACE to capture a Scientist target.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578980/extras/c3446a1aab13261c2dd98eb43ede9355.poster.avif?t=1751154646\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578980/extras/c3446a1aab13261c2dd98eb43ede9355.webm?t=1751154646\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578980/extras/c3446a1aab13261c2dd98eb43ede9355.mp4?t=1751154646\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Press ENTER to view the current scene of the current locker.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578980/extras/8307d12eb00ae9ab74c54489860335c0.poster.avif?t=1751154646\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578980/extras/8307d12eb00ae9ab74c54489860335c0.webm?t=1751154646\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578980/extras/8307d12eb00ae9ab74c54489860335c0.mp4?t=1751154646\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
